### Variables
@proxy = https://localhost:7257

### Full issuance flow in two calls (proxy captures every internal hop)
### 1. Mint an offer on the Issuer
POST {{proxy}}/issuer/credential-offer
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2. Hand the offerUri from the response above to the Holder wallet
@offerUri = REPLACE-ME

POST {{proxy}}/holder/wallet/redeem-offer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "offerUri": "{{offerUri}}"
}

### Captured proxy traffic (JSON)
GET {{proxy}}/traffic

### Service home pages
GET {{proxy}}/issuer/
GET {{proxy}}/holder/
GET {{proxy}}/verifier/
